/* Actual HTTP/Chromium/WebKit application checks. Only the new idle controller's
 * dependency clock is replaced in this test server's JS response. Date, browser
 * timers, rendering, input, engine, storage and animations remain native. Native
 * cue animations are paused/searched only for deterministic visual evidence.
 * Visibility/pagehide probes below are explicitly synthetic lifecycle events;
 * these checks do not claim physical-device or native BFCache coverage. */
